20931114559,"t":"10 According to research, 26% of visitor satisfaction is related to their accommodation.","x":0.071428573105466367,"c":1,"h":0.018895348808647183,"w":0.81766916910807297},{"c":1,"y":0.43748263848171631,"t":"11 Visitors to New Zealand like to become involved in the local culture.","h":0.023364345258232611,"w":0.6733602905273437,"x":0.069369741142041141},{"h":0.023300531980535499,"x":0.069399477612909669,"c":1,"y":0.46851925104437231,"w":0.76159571329752607,"t":"12 Visitors like staying in small hotels in New Zealand rather than in larger ones."},{"x":0.069447637379186536,"c":1,"y":0.49910231402198968,"w":0.79720937093098942,"h":0.021317768772417534,"t":"13 Many visitors feel it is unlikely that they will return to New Zealand after their visit."}]}